{"seq":4,"slug":"referential-transparency","title":"引用透明性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/referential-transparency","wordCount":1152,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"引用透明性\">引用透明性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>引用透明性</strong>是纯函数的等价表述：表达式可以被它的值替换而程序行为不变。这一性质像多米诺骨牌，撑起了等式推理、惰性求值、缓存和并行计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>由此获得的能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引用透明</td>\n<td>表达式可被其值安全替换</td>\n<td>求值顺序无关、可局部推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等式推理</td>\n<td>像代数一样对程序做等价变换</td>\n<td>map 融合等编译优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性求值</td>\n<td>表达式按需才求值</td>\n<td>无限数据结构、避免无用计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Memoization</td>\n<td>缓存纯函数的结果</td>\n<td>指数复杂度降为线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行安全</td>\n<td>无共享可变状态</td>\n<td>天然无锁、结果确定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：引用透明性让&quot;计算&quot;变成&quot;代换&quot;，而代换是可以随意重排、缓存和并行的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定义与本质\">定义与本质</h2><p><strong>引用透明性</strong>（Referential Transparency）是函数式编程的核心性质：一个表达式可以被它的值替换，而不改变程序的行为。换言之，如果 <code>f(x)</code> 的值是 <code>y</code>，那么程序中所有出现的 <code>f(x)</code> 都可以安全地替换为 <code>y</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const add = (a: number, b: number): number =&gt; a + b;&#10;&#10;const x = add(2, 3);&#10;const result = x + x;&#10;// 等价于&#10;const result2 = add(2, 3) + add(2, 3);&#10;// 等价于&#10;const result3 = 5 + 5;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"let x = add 2 3&#10;let result = x + x&#10;-- 等价于 add 2 3 + add 2 3&#10;-- 等价于 5 + 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let x = add 2 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let result = x + x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等价于 add 2 3 + add 2 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等价于 5 + 5</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>引用透明</th>\n<th>引用不透明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>替换安全</td>\n<td>表达式可被其值替换</td>\n<td>替换可能改变行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求值顺序</td>\n<td>不影响结果</td>\n<td>顺序可能影响结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>可能产生竞态条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等式推理</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n<td>无法使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>可安全 memoize</td>\n<td>缓存可能导致错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 引用透明&#10;        E1[&quot;add(2, 3)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;总是 = 5&quot;| V1[&quot;5&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;add(2, 3)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;总是 = 5&quot;| V2[&quot;5&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 引用不透明&#10;        E3[&quot;Date.now()&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;第一次&quot;| V3[&quot;1711929600000&quot;]&#10;        E4[&quot;Date.now()&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;第二次&quot;| V4[&quot;1711929600042&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 引用透明\n        E1[\"add(2, 3)\"] --&gt;|\"总是 = 5\"| V1[\"5\"]\n        E2[\"add(2, 3)\"] --&gt;|\"总是 = 5\"| V2[\"5\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 引用不透明\n        E3[\"Date.now()\"] --&gt;|\"第一次\"| V3[\"1711929600000\"]\n        E4[\"Date.now()\"] --&gt;|\"第二次\"| V4[\"1711929600042\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 引用透明性是纯函数的直接推论。如果一个函数是纯的，那么它的调用表达式就是引用透明的。反过来，如果一个表达式不是引用透明的，那么它一定涉及副作用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"等式推理\">等式推理</h2><p>引用透明性最重要的实际意义是支持<strong>等式推理</strong>（Equational Reasoning）——像代数推导一样推理程序行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"map f (map g xs)&#10;-- 由 map 的定义：map f . map g = map (f . g)&#10;-- 等价于&#10;map (f . g) xs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>map f (map g xs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 由 map 的定义：map f . map g = map (f . g)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map (f . g) xs</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const double = (x: number): number =&gt; x * 2;&#10;const increment = (x: number): number =&gt; x + 1;&#10;&#10;const result1 = [1, 2, 3].map(double).map(increment);&#10;&#10;const doubleAndIncrement = (x: number): number =&gt; increment(double(x));&#10;const result2 = [1, 2, 3].map(doubleAndIncrement);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(double).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(increment);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> doubleAndIncrement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doubleAndIncrement);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等式推理可以推导出的优化规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等式规则</th>\n<th>原始表达式</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map 融合</td>\n<td><code>map f (map g xs)</code></td>\n<td><code>map (f . g) xs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter 融合</td>\n<td><code>filter p (filter q xs)</code></td>\n<td><code>filter (x =&gt; p(x) &amp;&amp; q(x)) xs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>map-filter 交换</td>\n<td><code>filter p (map f xs)</code></td>\n<td><code>map f (filter (p . f) xs)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>foldr 融合</td>\n<td><code>foldr f z (map g xs)</code></td>\n<td><code>foldr (f . g) z xs</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[[1,2,3].map(g).map(f)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;两次遍历&quot;| B[&quot;中间数组 → 最终数组&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;等式推理&quot;| C[[1,2,3].map(f ∘ g)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;一次遍历&quot;| D[&quot;最终数组&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[[1,2,3].map(g).map(f)\"] --&gt;|\"两次遍历\"| B[\"中间数组 → 最终数组\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"等式推理\"| C[[1,2,3].map(f ∘ g)\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"一次遍历\"| D[\"最终数组\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"惰性求值与引用透明\">惰性求值与引用透明</h2><p>引用透明性使得<strong>惰性求值</strong>（Lazy Evaluation）成为可能。因为表达式的值不依赖求值时机，编译器可以自由选择何时计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"take 5 (repeat 1)        -- [1,1,1,1,1]&#10;take 3 [1..]             -- [1,2,3]&#10;head (map (+1) [1..])    -- 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>take 5 (repeat 1)        -- [1,1,1,1,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>take 3 [1..]             -- [1,2,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>head (map (+1) [1..])    -- 2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function* naturals(): Generator&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  let n = 0;&#10;  while (true) yield n++;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function* take&lt;A&gt;(n: number, gen: Generator&lt;A&gt;): Generator&lt;A&gt; {&#10;  let count = 0;&#10;  for (const val of gen) {&#10;    if (count &gt;= n) return;&#10;    yield val;&#10;    count++;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const first5 = [...take(5, naturals())];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> naturals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Generator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> take</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Generator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Generator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gen) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> first5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">take</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">naturals</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())];</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>求值策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严格求值</td>\n<td>表达式立即求值</td>\n<td>性能可预测</td>\n<td>可能计算不必要的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性求值</td>\n<td>表达式在需要时才求值</td>\n<td>避免不必要计算</td>\n<td>空间泄漏风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短路求值</td>\n<td>逻辑表达式提前终止</td>\n<td>避免错误</td>\n<td>仅限布尔表达式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Haskell 是默认惰性求值的语言。正是因为 Haskell 强制要求引用透明（通过类型系统隔离副作用），惰性求值才能安全地工作——如果函数有副作用，延迟执行的时机就会变得不可预测。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"memoization\">Memoization</h2><p>引用透明性直接支持<strong>记忆化</strong>（Memoization）：对于相同输入，纯函数总是返回相同输出，因此可以安全地缓存结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const memoize = &lt;A extends string | number, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; B): ((a: A) =&gt; B) =&gt; {&#10;  const cache = new Map&lt;A, B&gt;();&#10;  return (a: A): B =&gt; {&#10;    if (!cache.has(a)) {&#10;      cache.set(a, f(a));&#10;    }&#10;    return cache.get(a)!;&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;const fib = memoize((n: number): number =&gt; (n &lt;= 1 ? n : fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> memoize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </